My first valkyrie ascension wished for 3 cursed scrolls of genocide and
reverse genocided tengu, used a tinning kit on the corpses, and got the
intrinsic from eating the tins.  It might be more efficient to wish for a
cursed magic marker, if you've got blank scrolls to burn (and you've seen
?oGeno)

